# =============================================================================
#  Line endings
# =============================================================================
#  The shell scripts (backend/start.sh, database/initdb/*.sh) are executed
#  *inside Linux containers*. A CRLF (Windows) checkout would break them with
#  "bad interpreter: /bin/sh^M" or "not found", so every text file is checked
#  out with LF on every operating system - including Windows machines, where
#  Git would otherwise convert them.
# =============================================================================
* text=auto eol=lf

# The historical market data files must stay byte-for-byte as they were
# generated: never convert or re-encode them.
*.csv -text
*.zip -text
*.png -text
